WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.350
Some letters arrive at night.

2
00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:10.320
GetMyYes reads yours with you, line by line, in plain English. The summary is free.

3
00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:15.620
Then it helps you build the appeal: the letter, the evidence, the deadline.

4
00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:19.620
You check every page. And you send it yourself.

5
00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:24.550
GetMyYes. Understand the denial. Build the appeal.
